  "body": "This jointly reassigns all twelve T74 source aliases, including the four older recovery paths held fixed by PR2720. All eight central recursive children remain rank8. After composing PR2679's six pre-life hosts/refit and PR2673's complete owner allocation, the new conditional \u03ba is **0.001717141586348426338109\u2026**, about **0.05834% above PR2733 and PR2745**. The exact rational is `0.001717141586348426338109 - 10^-46 - 10^-70`; the selected frontier is unchanged.\n\nThe four changed `(removed helper, source, partner)` assignments are `(696,33,49),(697,55,101),(698,74,83),(700,85,98)`. PR2696's eight assignments are retained. Both members of each old source pair are recovered after their last original uses; all compensation and inverse cleanup are generated from the actual symbolic word. The twelve lifted target offsets avoid every cut target. This changes PR2720's fixed-path premise rather than contradicting its scoped obstruction.\n\nThe full profile improves by `2664*(H8-H7-H1)` relative to PR2733; strict subadditivity proves a smaller paid moment for `0<p<1`. Physical stock remains66801, with415 helpers,72 private buffers,666 calls and276390 hosted roles. The complete profile is `{1:1593072,2:430236,3:204396,4:79920,5:22532,8:5328,32:1,48:26558}`. Every source recovery, frame, copy, cleanup, child and idle remainder is charged.\n\nValidation:\n\n- Both changed native providers passed all five stages freshly. The complete strict supplier and modern outer release passed, including63 exact outer inequalities,17 rejecting controls and19 inherited evidence replays. Authenticated retained-parent/native evidence is explicitly reused.\n- The public full wrapper passed end to end with exact local pristine source and the published authenticated cache. The default remote-download/all-fresh branch was not run as one invocation; execution coverage is recorded in `EVIDENCE.json`.\n- The portable generator positively reconstructs both complete PR2462 words and regenerates both new complete words. Independent symbolic forward/dual, actual frames, cleanup, full hosting and rational adjacent root-bracket checks pass.\n- Registered Python3.12 replay passes, including mathematical mutations, Git-free read-only relocation, altered claim/input rejection and optimized-execution refusal. Both latest comparison claims are pinned and compared exactly.\n\n```sh\npython3.12 -B scripts/research_package.py --package research/t74-joint-twelve\n# Full release (install package requirements.txt; fresh external directory):\npython3 -B research/t74-joint-twelve/full_replay.py --work /tmp/FRESH-joint-twelve\n```\n\nOnly `research/t74-joint-twelve/` is added: approximately5.8MB including compressed complete certificates, portable generator and a readable derivative-checker patch. No giant predecessor source import. Mutation adaptations retain failure coverage for actual changed gates and unsplit centre descents. The generic coverage-law cap is `.001750373331784`, realized fraction`.9810144814068302`; no sharp packing optimum is claimed.\n\nScientific base `c22e42de697334df85337e005864773cdc2bc98b`; canonical main fetched through `7ef5f7150476fdf995b286b9cdbed262c631939c`, relevant guidance and selected record unchanged. Submission overlap includes727 open PR bodies and recent discussions; limits and exact heads are in `FRESHNESS.json`.\n\nPrepared by Tekalign (@tekuuu) with substantial OpenAI Codex assistance. Credit Mason Hale/2696, Philippe Van Velzen/2679/2559, Jeremy Kothe/2462/2588/2673/2745, zxv/2530, themilkman216/2621, Marius-Paul Dumitrean/2733, Cinna Davis/2226, the2436 lifted-target work and retained native/owner/bit/outer lineage. Notices are preserved; new work Apache-2.0. No independent human or proof-assistant review claimed.\n\nThis is a **conditional construction**, not an unconditional multiplication theorem or practical speed benchmark. Inherited all-size/compiler, common-label/source access, physical hosting/routing, precision/tape, recovery/analytic transfer, recurrence, bit-supplier and outer assumptions remain. README includes open next questions.\n",
